# Everything that must not reach a build context.
#
# Without this, `COPY src/ src/` drags node_modules (hundreds of megabytes) and bin/obj into the
# image layer, which is both enormous and wrong — obj/ holds paths from the host machine that break
# the build inside the container.

**/node_modules/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/TestResults/
artifacts/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

docs/
tests/
*.md
!src/WorkBoard.Web/README.md

# Local secrets and overrides, which must never be baked into an image.
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/*.user
.env
.env.*

docker-compose*.yml
